1051
01:15:17.560 --> 01:15:18.641
Now, you may go.

1052
01:15:22.280 --> 01:15:25.284
You.
I'm gonna see you real soon.

1053
01:15:25.640 --> 01:15:27.563
I'm gonna see you real soon.

1054
01:15:27.640 --> 01:15:28.641
